
  <sn><md>### Branches of Ecology {.text-center}

Historical Foundations &amp; Primary Subdivisions

* **Plant vs. Animal Ecology:** Early ecological studies divided the field based on whether plants or animals were being examined.
* **Bioecology:** As scientists recognized the interconnected nature of plants and animals within ecosystems, this unified term was adopted to give equal emphasis to both groups.
